we can sleep easy tonight...","nextNodeIds":[751940402]},{"nodeId":751940402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":894201554,"text":"It's all thanks to you, of course. If you hadn't stepped in and helped us without holding grudges, things wouldn't have gone so smoothly.","nextNodeIds":[751940403]},{"nodeId":751940403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":3713620362,"text":"Please, take this as a token of my gratitude — and as an apology, to boot!","nextNodeIds":[751940404]},{"nodeId":751940404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":540731466,"text":"Hehe, well, since you put it that way... we graciously accept!","nextNodeIds":[751940405]},{"nodeId":751940405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2193379754,"text":"What do you plan to do next?","nextNodeIds":[751940406]},{"nodeId":751940406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":1686232178,"text":"I've still got some cargo stocked up. Normal operations should put our finances back on track.","nextNodeIds":[751940407]},{"nodeId":751940407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":3430973930,"text":"Of course, we're not in an emergency situation this time, so I'll be doing honest business, don't you worry!","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7519405,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":true,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7519404","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7519405,"initDialog":751940501,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[6459],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":75194,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":751940501,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":4225126658,"text":"Ten, twenty... Sold a bunch of stuff, so our finances should be healthy for now...","nextNodeIds":[751940502,751940510]},{"nodeId":751940502,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1291953586,"text":"Not going to try and make a bit more?","nextNodeIds":[751940503]},{"nodeId":751940503,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":886733074,"text":"Haha, nope! I'm calling it quits for now! If you hadn't been so understanding and helped me out, I'd have gotten myself into trouble over those couple of jade bits for sure.","nextNodeIds":[751940504]},{"nodeId":751940504,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":4142809010,"text":"Besides, constantly chasing money is boring. It's just a hobby for me. Observing the volcano is what really matters.","nextNodeIds":[751940505]},{"nodeId":751940505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":1057037994,"text":"We can always make more money, but if an eruption warning doesn't get sent out on our account... that would be a huge loss.","nextNodeIds":[751940506]},{"nodeId":751940506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":802258818,"text":"Don't you get funding from the Speaker's Chamber?","nextNodeIds":[751940507]},{"nodeId":751940507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":3552441594,"text":"We didn't apply for any. With all the stuff they already have to deal with on the daily, I doubt they need the extra stress.","nextNodeIds":[751940508]},{"nodeId":751940508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":1608310938,"text":"The gang and I are a different story. We're used to funding our own travels by picking up odd jobs as we go. It's become a lifestyle, you know?","nextNodeIds":[751940509]},{"nodeId":751940509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":2489737594,"text":"As such, monitoring the volcano while we travel isn't a big deal, just like how you often help people in need — it just comes naturally!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":751940510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":291817554,"text":"Alright then, see you around.","nextNodeIds":[751940511]},{"nodeId":751940511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6459,"speakerName":"Kulemana","textMapHash":1499708346,"text":"Take care, hehe. May we meet again!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7519404,0],"